#. (itstool) path: caption/para
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:753
msgid ""
"Creating subforums. In this example, the subforums titled \"Cats\" and "
"\"Dogs\" belong in the \"Pets\" parent forum. Pay close attention to the "
"breadcrumbs on the page, located right above the list of the subforums. This"
