"Ordner haben können."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:930
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Full folder default action</guilabel>: Sometimes your users want "
"to send each other a private message, but the intended recipient has a full "
"folder. This setting will define exactly what will happen to the sent "
"message. You can either set it so that an old message will be deleted to "
"make room for the new message, or the new messages will be held back until "
"the recipient makes room in his inbox. Note that the default action for the "
